          "Defend education funding investment with fiscal discipline: the 45% college-attainment rate indicates a constituency with direct investment in high-quality schools, and any Republican messaging that implies indifference to education quality will drive defection to Democratic challengers who can credibly promise school funding. The argument is not 'education vs. taxes' but 'fiscally disciplined investment in schools that produces returns'.",
