          "Maintain fluency on the economic concerns of college-educated professionals under forty: the 41.3% college attainment and young median age identify a constituency managing student debt, early-career income constraints, and the transition to property ownership. Healthcare costs, education affordability, and professional-workforce development are the issues that keep this demographic within the Republican coalition rather than the inherited assumption that they will remain Republican.",
