          "Lead with renter economic security: property tax policy, tenant protections, utility costs, and the relationship between state and local housing policy are the material concerns of a 69.4% renter constituency at $78,130 income in a high-cost metropolitan region, and they are amenable to specific legislative remedies that distinguish active governance from inherited partisan advantage.",
