        memoHeadline: "Jersey City's Latino-Majority District at 55.6% Hispanic, 64% Renter, $64.7K Income: Democrats Swept Both Seats in 2025, but Economic Insecurity and Housing Pressure Remain the Core Constituency Concern.",
